body("**5 — Realised over Provisioned**  ·  Proposition 4: the quotient 1/(1 + ε) · the value of ε — a selection, argued and booked");
body("**6 — The Placement**  ·  Proposition 5: the arena’s commitment lives in the arena’s coupling — forced");
body("**7 — The Double Entry**  ·  Proposition 6: an extension of AP24’s licence, stated as an extension");
