body("**D-CCC.4 (Boundary selection).** The value of ε in the quotient is α_em — a selection among the domain readings AP06 §0.7 holds open, argued in §5 from the coupling denomination, not derived. The formal closure of the selection is owed. Load-bearing for §9: if the constitution reads at a different boundary, the correction rescales and the prediction fails.");
