body("Six kill switches engage, identifiers pending registration in the Master Kill Switch Registry. **KS-CCC.1** (forced magnitude): LIVE — METHODOLOGICAL. **KS-CCC.2** (mass-side drift): LIVE — STRUCTURAL/EMPIRICAL. **KS-CCC.3** (existence and direction): LIVE — EMPIRICAL. **KS-CCC.4** (the discriminator): LIVE — EMPIRICAL. **KS-CCC.5** (held, not shed): LIVE — STRUCTURAL. **KS-CCC.6** (single entry): LIVE — STRUCTURAL, coupled to KS-R.9.");
