h1("Notation Reference");
body("**1:1 + 1×ε @ AS**  —  The axiom. The balance, the one unpaired element, read at the Actualization State.");
body("**ε**  —  The unique unpaired element of Axiom B. Its value in the quotient, α_em, is a selection among AP06’s open domain family (§5; D-CCC.4).");
body("**α_em**  —  The fine-structure constant ≈ 1/137.036. The per-channel coupling (AP28 Proposition 5) and the leakage rate (AP06).");
